workbook :integration_cli_audit, type: :design

# Integration CLI audit — which providers ship an official CLI

Generated by the `integration-cli-scan` workflow (48 agents, 708 unique providers across the 873
integration toolkits, deduped by `provider`). Each provider was judged for a **first-party, officially-
published CLI** only — community wrappers, generic HTTP/curl, and non-CLI SDKs do **not** count. Brand
knowledge first; targeted web search for the uncertain ones.

## Totals

- **708** providers scanned
- **98** have an official CLI (13.8%)
- **610** have NO official CLI (86.2%)
- confidence: 519 high · 157 medium · 32 low

## Has an official CLI (98)

